Explanation of the changes:

1. We drop the `throw new LHError(LHError.errors.NO_FCP)` branch entirely.
2. We import both `firstContentfulPaint` and `firstPaint` (the latter is always emitted, even for background tabs).
3. When FCP is missing, we transparently use the FP value (or 0 if even FP is unavailable) so that all downstream performance audits can still execute.
